<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">CrowdQuery: Density-Guided Query Module for Enhanced 2D and 3D Detection in Crowded Scenes
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Marius Dähling
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Karlsruhe Institute of Technology (KIT), Karlsruhe, Germany
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Mercedes-Benz AG, Research and Development, Stuttgart, Germany
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
